  "_comment": "Rank-tracker keyword set for klaussa.com, sorted by OPPORTUNITY rather than by raw impressions. Opportunity = monthly search volume x ease (100-difficulty), boosted 1.6x where we already rank 11-30 and 1.25x at 31-50, because moving a page that already ranks is far cheaper than creating one that does not. Terms we already hold in the top 10 are damped 0.7x -- they need defending, not chasing. Every keyword here carries measurable Google volume; the previous set spent 34% of its budget on long-tail Google cannot even size.",
  "_sources": "Klaussa's own ranked-keyword set (100 pulled), the previously tracked 130 hydrated with real volume, and gap terms held by Legal Hero, Justisio and Veritask.",
  "_recycling": "The core set is FIXED for the POC so week-1 and week-4 positions stay comparable. Only the long-tail group rotates: at each month boundary, drop any long-tail keyword whose volume has fallen to zero and replace it from the current opportunity pool. Never rotate the brand, category-commercial, or quick-win groups mid-POC -- those are the measurement baseline.",
